{"v":2,"catch":"解放貓鬚的力量，從怪物手中保衛家園！","desc":"本作是一款結合了即時戰略、塔防、三消等要素的超搞笑動作遊戲。遊戲中，身經百戰的重武裝貓咪老兵們將會在和老鼠們的小規模衝突及混亂的毛線團中發揮牠們的重要作用。不只保衛自己的家園（還有貓砂盆），更要抵禦巨大的邪惡勢力！利用多種不同的貓科動物與高達50種的邪惡生物作戰吧！","publisher":"Game Source Entertainment","release":"2024-09-05","genres":["模擬","益智"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)","波蘭文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"size":"Switch 2 0.7GB / Switch 0.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d131ba1dfdc935388ee11a31571016a78ace4d5d08bfeef3ff0167da29e99e07.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4854dd74253866a390e7b92f924f461555845f6c91681366fb4a3c637af7ad8c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e4efed8eb002c39d01c7ff6c281d906e845b8ea302b290b74c95a7d5ca784639.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1abea35dce569f326fdd1905f0c407b66ee23c189bd506aa5c34e9ab33e185b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c5307ba76b441932aff31a3ae25e698107498862cd530c5cb9eede7dfeb3d843.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ad35ec96a5a0eeec7f6b73edea30878553b816bd0082a63ab79a694663157f18.jpg"],"titleId":"010035101f77e000"}